WEBVTT

00:15.130 --> 00:21.940
Kokoro no mori no naka kimi ni deau koto

00:15.130 --> 00:21.940
I was always dreaming of meeting you

00:16.130 --> 00:22.180
<b>Zettai Shonen</b>

00:21.940 --> 00:26.970
Itsumo yume mitetan da

00:21.940 --> 00:26.970
within my heart’s forest.

00:26.970 --> 00:33.150
Hikari no silhouette sono saki wo mezashite

00:26.970 --> 00:33.150
The silhouette of light guides the way.

00:33.150 --> 00:38.750
Itsuka ai ni furete mitai

00:33.150 --> 00:38.750
One day, I’d like to try and experience love.

00:38.750 --> 00:44.460
Kimochi to kotoba niji to mizutamari

00:38.750 --> 00:44.460
My feelings and words can be like rainbows and puddles.

00:44.460 --> 00:51.860
Omoiau yasashisa ga michibiku ashita he to

00:44.460 --> 00:51.860
The kindness we share will guide us into tomorrow.

00:51.860 --> 00:57.370
Kimi ga iru dake de tsuyoku nareru kara

00:51.860 --> 00:57.370
With only you here, I can become stronger.

00:57.370 --> 01:03.680
Sora takaku negai wo kanadeyou

00:57.370 --> 01:03.680
My wish will be granted in the heights of the sky.

01:03.680 --> 01:09.050
Nanika taisetsu ka wo miushinawanu you ni

01:03.680 --> 01:09.050
You won’t lose sight of something precious to you,

01:09.050 --> 01:18.330
Kitto motto kagayaku kara

01:09.050 --> 01:18.330
because I’m sure it’ll shine even brighter.

01:18.330 --> 01:23.760
Kimi ga iru dake de tsuyoku nareru no sa

01:18.330 --> 01:23.760
With only you here, I can become stronger.

01:23.760 --> 01:30.140
Ima dekiru koto kara hajimeyou

01:23.760 --> 01:30.140
Let’s start with what we can do right now.

01:30.140 --> 01:35.540
Mawarimichi demo ii jibun wo shinjite

01:30.140 --> 01:35.540
I don’t mind if we take a detour, 
as long as you believe in yourself.

01:35.540 --> 01:44.650
Kitto motto sono saki he to

01:35.540 --> 01:44.650
By doing that, I’m sure we can go even further.

02:18.850 --> 02:22.480
<b>I... saw Dosshiru.</b>

02:24.420 --> 02:27.180
<b>Shisshin wasn’t there, though.</b>

02:31.060 --> 02:33.490
<b>I wanted to touch it, but...</b>

02:33.490 --> 02:35.030
<b>...I restrained myself.</b>

02:36.330 --> 02:39.030
<b>It gave off a really good feeling.</b>

02:42.500 --> 02:45.040
<b>I wonder if it’ll come again...?</b>

02:47.610 --> 02:51.540
<b>Class 13... Aizawa Ayumu.</b>

03:14.070 --> 03:15.730
<b><i>Dosshiru...?</i></b>

03:19.310 --> 03:26.280
<b>The Tsukiyomi Observatory
and Old Lady Okaka</b>

03:24.550 --> 03:28.720
<b>Kishiro Animal Hospital</b>

03:40.090 --> 03:41.330
<b>Looking for something?</b>

03:42.560 --> 03:44.200
<b>Umm...</b>

03:44.200 --> 03:45.800
<b>Are you a friend of Ayumu?</b>

03:45.800 --> 03:48.100
<b>Ah... yeah, I guess you could say that.</b>

03:48.100 --> 03:50.400
<b>Umm... where’s Mr. “I”–</b>

03:50.400 --> 03:53.040
<b>...er, I mean Ayumu-kun?</b>

03:53.040 --> 03:55.440
<b>Not down there, I’d imagine.</b>

03:55.440 --> 03:56.040
<b>Yeah...</b>

03:56.040 --> 03:58.080
<b>He’s out somewhere right now.</b>

03:58.080 --> 04:01.080
<b>I see. Well, I guess that’s that.</b>

04:02.010 --> 04:04.780
<b>Do you know of Old Lady Okaka?</b>

04:06.280 --> 04:07.650
<b>I’m afraid I don’t.</b>

04:07.650 --> 04:08.690
<b>I see.</b>

04:11.490 --> 04:12.320
<b>You down there.</b>

04:13.200 --> 04:13.230
<b>Kishiro Animal Hospital</b>

04:13.230 --> 04:13.260
<b>Kishiro Animal Hospital</b>

04:13.260 --> 04:13.300
<b>Kishiro Animal Hospital</b>

04:13.300 --> 04:13.330
<b>Kishiro Animal Hospital</b>

04:13.330 --> 04:13.360
<b>Kishiro Animal Hospital</b>

04:13.360 --> 04:13.400
<b>Kishiro Animal Hospital</b>

04:13.400 --> 04:13.430
<b>Kishiro Animal Hospital</b>

04:13.430 --> 04:13.470
<b>Kishiro Animal Hospital</b>

04:13.470 --> 04:13.500
<b>Kishiro Animal Hospital</b>

04:13.500 --> 04:13.530
<b>Kishiro Animal Hospital</b>

04:13.530 --> 04:13.570
<b>Kishiro Animal Hospital</b>

04:13.570 --> 04:13.600
<b>Kishiro Animal Hospital</b>

04:13.600 --> 04:13.630
<b>Kishiro Animal Hospital</b>

04:13.630 --> 04:13.670
<b>Kishiro Animal Hospital</b>

04:13.670 --> 04:13.700
<b>Kishiro Animal Hospital</b>

04:13.700 --> 04:17.340
<b>Kishiro Animal Hospital</b>

04:14.230 --> 04:16.630
<b>Next time you come, use the front door, please.</b>

04:16.630 --> 04:17.330
<b>Yes, sir...</b>

05:15.250 --> 05:16.860
<b>Hey.</b>

05:16.860 --> 05:20.290
<b>Oh, Ryousuke. Was today bad again?</b>

05:20.890 --> 05:22.860
<b>Was it “bad”?</b>

05:22.860 --> 05:24.800
<b>Well, I guess it wasn’t any worse than usual.</b>

05:24.800 --> 05:28.030
<b>I just crawled into the vet’s backyard.</b>

05:28.030 --> 05:29.370
<b>You sure act through small actions.</b>

05:29.370 --> 05:30.900
<b>Don’t say “small.”</b>

05:30.900 --> 05:33.410
<b>And besides, small things will eventually add up.</b>

05:33.410 --> 05:34.840
<b>See? You do act through small actions.</b>

05:34.840 --> 05:36.470
<b>It’s called using “sound reasoning.”</b>

05:37.280 --> 05:37.980
<b>It’s useless anyway.</b>

05:38.540 --> 05:40.710
<b>Old Lady Okaka isn’t there.</b>

05:40.710 --> 05:42.280
<b>Then where is she?</b>

05:42.280 --> 05:44.380
<b>Stop chasing her around.</b>

05:44.380 --> 05:46.350
<b>If you can do that much,
she’ll come to you on her own.</b>

05:46.350 --> 05:47.990
<b>I don’t know about that...</b>

05:47.990 --> 05:50.460
<b>After all, this’ll be the last summer.</b>

05:50.460 --> 05:51.720
<b>What?</b>

05:51.720 --> 05:54.490
<b>Will you finally be taking your exams and becoming a full-fledged member of society?</b>

05:54.490 --> 05:55.890
<b>There’s that too, but...</b>

05:55.890 --> 05:58.500
<b>...Old Lady Okaka must be pretty old by now, right?</b>

05:58.500 --> 06:01.430
<b>When I first heard the rumors
that she had died, I had...</b>

06:02.070 --> 06:03.100
<b>What’s it called...</b>

06:04.400 --> 06:05.470
<b>That feeling...</b>

06:05.470 --> 06:07.510
<b>Lamentation, huh?</b>

06:07.510 --> 06:10.440
<b>You sure know some big words, don’t you?</b>

06:10.440 --> 06:14.880
<b>It’s no good, though... even if I know them,
I don’t really understand them.</b>

06:14.880 --> 06:19.790
<b>Huh? I don’t really get what you’re
saying, but I hate that feeling.</b>

06:19.790 --> 06:24.460
<b>That’s why when I heard she was
reborn, I was really happy.</b>

06:24.460 --> 06:28.160
<b>After all, I wasn’t able to see her off.</b>

06:28.160 --> 06:29.530
<b>I guess that makes sense.</b>

06:29.530 --> 06:32.930
<b>That’s why I definitely have to
see her again this summer.</b>

06:32.930 --> 06:33.970
<b>You will.</b>

06:33.970 --> 06:35.230
<b>Really?</b>

06:35.230 --> 06:36.100
<b>Yeah.</b>

06:36.100 --> 06:37.270
<b>Where?</b>

06:37.270 --> 06:39.740
<b>How am I supposed to know that much?</b>

06:39.740 --> 06:40.670
<b>I guess.</b>

06:53.750 --> 06:54.750
<b>Welcome.</b>

06:54.750 --> 06:56.390
<b>I’m not here as a customer.</b>

06:56.390 --> 06:57.760
<b>I don’t mind either way.</b>

06:57.760 --> 06:59.960
<b>After all, this is my family’s liquor store.</b>

06:59.960 --> 07:00.930
<b>Yeah.</b>

07:00.930 --> 07:02.430
<b>So what’s up?</b>

07:02.430 --> 07:04.400
<b>Well... you see...</b>

07:07.470 --> 07:08.930
<b>Old Lady Okaka...</b>

07:08.930 --> 07:11.770
<b>You’re right. She really is alive.</b>

07:13.940 --> 07:15.340
<b>Why “Old Lady Okaka,” anyway?</b>

07:16.110 --> 07:18.140
<b>You mean how we came up with her name?</b>

07:18.140 --> 07:19.340
<b>Wait here a sec.</b>

07:55.810 --> 07:58.320
<b>Huh? Where’d she go?</b>

08:00.090 --> 08:01.290
<b>She left.</b>

08:01.290 --> 08:02.490
<b>That’s odd...</b>

08:02.490 --> 08:05.960
<b>Normally she just stays put
until I feed her some okaka.</b>

08:05.960 --> 08:07.130
<b>Did you do something?</b>

08:07.130 --> 08:07.790
<b>No...</b>

08:08.490 --> 08:11.460
<b>Oh yeah, you were saying something?</b>

08:11.460 --> 08:14.230
<b>Ah, I was wondering if your little sister was around.</b>

08:14.230 --> 08:15.330
<b>Miku?</b>

08:15.330 --> 08:17.640
<b>There was something I wanted to ask her.</b>

08:17.640 --> 08:19.140
<b>I see...</b>

08:19.140 --> 08:22.470
<b>Umm... if you’re looking for her,
she’s probably up at the temple.</b>

08:22.470 --> 08:23.270
<b>The temple?</b>

08:24.080 --> 08:26.750
<b>It’s just to the right of the community center.</b>

08:26.750 --> 08:29.920
<b>It seems like she plays up there a lot.</b>

08:29.920 --> 08:32.180
<b>I see. Thanks.</b>

08:35.250 --> 08:37.760
<b>I see... Miku, huh?</b>

09:05.460 --> 09:08.900
<b>Kamikaze</b>

09:05.490 --> 09:05.520
<b> Cat Dance</b>

09:05.520 --> 09:08.900
<b> Cat Dance</b>

09:23.270 --> 09:24.770
<b>Unno</b>

09:23.270 --> 09:24.770
<b>Incoming</b>

09:41.720 --> 09:42.750
<b>Over there?!</b>

09:45.620 --> 09:47.130
<b>You’re...</b>

09:47.130 --> 09:48.660
<b>Are you alone?</b>

09:53.270 --> 09:55.430
<b>So you had a family.</b>

09:55.430 --> 09:58.600
<b>Hey, you cats!
 Have you seen Old Lady Okaka?</b>

09:59.500 --> 10:01.470
<b>I get it...</b>

10:02.110 --> 10:04.180
<b>I’m not going to hurt you.</b>

10:04.180 --> 10:06.950
<b>I’m sorry. Don’t hate me over this.</b>

10:19.020 --> 10:19.890
<b>Where is she?</b>

10:30.370 --> 10:31.600
<b>She plays...</b>

10:33.870 --> 10:36.240
<b>...in a place like this?</b>

10:40.810 --> 10:41.660
<b>All by herself?</b>

11:14.610 --> 11:17.320
<b>Mikoshiba-san’s off again today?</b>

11:17.320 --> 11:18.980
<b>It’s just as you see.</b>

11:18.980 --> 11:20.380
<b>Here’s your change.</b>

11:21.650 --> 11:23.160
<b>Could I ask you something weird?</b>

11:23.160 --> 11:25.390
<b>If I say no, will you not ask?</b>

11:25.390 --> 11:27.330
<b>No... I...</b>

11:27.330 --> 11:29.360
<b>Then there’s no point in asking permission.</b>

11:29.360 --> 11:31.230
<b>Guess that’s true.</b>

11:31.230 --> 11:33.400
<b>Then, sorry for bringing this up so suddenly, but...</b>

11:33.400 --> 11:36.770
<b>...is it true that Old Lady Okaka was
originally Mikoshiba-san’s cat?</b>

11:36.770 --> 11:37.900
<b>I don’t know.</b>

11:37.900 --> 11:40.810
<b>After all, I wouldn’t have been around back then.</b>

11:40.810 --> 11:41.540
<b>Ah, right.</b>

11:41.540 --> 11:44.680
<b>The mysterious “ten year gap” of your life.</b>

11:42.210 --> 11:44.680
<b>Tanaya</b>

11:44.680 --> 11:46.110
<b>Hey, boy.</b>

11:46.780 --> 11:50.520
<b>Don’t summarize someone’s life so easily.</b>

11:50.520 --> 11:51.750
<b>Y-Yes, ma’am.</b>

11:55.420 --> 11:56.620
<b>Hey...</b>

11:56.620 --> 11:58.060
<b>Quit it... c’mon!</b>

11:58.060 --> 12:00.400
<b>Oh? So he’s become attached to you.</b>

12:01.090 --> 12:03.300
<b>You call this being attached to me?</b>

12:03.300 --> 12:04.960
<b>Don’t you think so?</b>

12:04.960 --> 12:06.360
<b>I’m more scared than anything...</b>

12:06.360 --> 12:09.300
<b>In the first place, aren’t dogs supposed to be leashed?</b>

12:09.300 --> 12:10.400
<b>Roku, come.</b>

12:14.410 --> 12:15.610
<b>So what’s going on?</b>

12:16.640 --> 12:17.610
<b>Nothing much.</b>

12:17.610 --> 12:19.540
<b>Hmm... come with me.</b>

12:21.580 --> 12:23.120
<b>Didn’t you hear me?</b>

12:23.120 --> 12:24.620
<b>Why?</b>

12:24.620 --> 12:29.650
<b>A pretentious parent 
will raise a pretentious child.</b>

12:29.650 --> 12:31.390
<b>I see you’re a fine example.</b>

12:35.530 --> 12:38.060
<b>It’s just some no-name valley, but...</b>

12:38.060 --> 12:41.100
<b>...it’s just too much area to search for a single cat.</b>

12:42.800 --> 12:43.770
<b>Crap!</b>

12:43.770 --> 12:46.170
<b>What are you playing around here for?</b>

12:46.170 --> 12:48.710
<b>If you have time to worry about
a cat, help out once in a while!</b>

12:48.710 --> 12:52.210
<b>Just try to understand!
I have to settle my score with her.</b>

12:52.210 --> 12:54.910
<b>That again? Give me a break already.</b>

12:54.910 --> 12:56.910
<b>That’s why I’m looking for her!</b>

12:57.950 --> 12:59.720
<b>I’m definitely not gonna budge on this!</b>

12:57.950 --> 13:00.120
<b>Sakakura Motors</b>

12:59.720 --> 13:01.250
<b>Ryousuke!</b>

13:01.250 --> 13:03.150
<b>Geez...</b>

13:27.310 --> 13:28.480
<b>Umm...</b>

13:30.020 --> 13:33.050
<b>“This world’s membrane grows thinner by the day.”</b>

13:33.050 --> 13:34.690
<b>What did you mean by that?</b>

13:34.690 --> 13:37.060
<b>So something really did happen.</b>

13:37.060 --> 13:38.190
<b>Probably.</b>

13:38.190 --> 13:40.290
<b>Well, it’s just as I said.</b>

13:40.290 --> 13:42.660
<b>No... I don’t understand.</b>

13:42.660 --> 13:45.900
<b>You’ll understand in due course.</b>

13:53.040 --> 13:54.470
<b>What’s up with you?</b>

14:04.180 --> 14:04.950
<b>Hey.</b>

14:04.950 --> 14:07.850
<b>Sorry, Takuma, but could I hide out here for a bit?</b>

14:07.850 --> 14:09.220
<b>Sure.</b>

14:09.220 --> 14:11.160
<b>Well, let’s go get some air.</b>

14:11.160 --> 14:13.930
<b>Why? You have air conditioning
in your room, don’t you?</b>

14:14.690 --> 14:16.660
<b>No, the wind is better for you.</b>

14:16.660 --> 14:18.330
<b>I’ll meet you on the veranda.</b>

14:24.740 --> 14:27.670
<b>So, what are you running from today?</b>

14:27.670 --> 14:28.770
<b>Don’t say “today.”</b>

14:28.770 --> 14:31.340
<b>It makes it sound like I’m always
running from something.</b>

14:31.340 --> 14:34.350
<b>From what I can tell, all you
do is chase around that cat.</b>

14:34.350 --> 14:36.250
<b>Though it always seems to escape you.</b>

14:36.250 --> 14:39.250
<b>You’ve... changed, huh?</b>

14:39.250 --> 14:40.790
<b>I’ve just matured.</b>

14:40.790 --> 14:42.790
<b>So you’re saying I’m still immature?</b>

14:42.790 --> 14:43.760
<b>Yeah.</b>

14:43.760 --> 14:46.090
<b>If not your body, then at least what you can do.</b>

14:46.090 --> 14:47.190
<b>What’s up with that?</b>

14:47.190 --> 14:48.730
<b>Who knows?</b>

14:48.730 --> 14:50.900
<b>Do I look so careless to you?</b>

14:50.900 --> 14:51.960
<b>Completely.</b>

14:52.560 --> 14:56.100
<b>Talking with you is getting to be really frustrating.</b>

14:58.270 --> 14:59.770
<b>Unno</b>

14:58.270 --> 14:59.770
<b>Incoming</b>

15:01.310 --> 15:02.740
<b>You’re not answering?</b>

15:03.580 --> 15:04.740
<b>No.</b>

15:09.210 --> 15:10.580
<b>Thanks for the drink.</b>

15:11.880 --> 15:14.590
<b>You should keep at it, you know.</b>

15:14.590 --> 15:15.950
<b>Kendo, that is.</b>

15:15.950 --> 15:17.620
<b>You can come back whenever you like.</b>

15:18.460 --> 15:19.090
<b>Yeah.</b>

15:23.560 --> 15:25.900
<b>Secondary River Channel</b>

16:03.030 --> 16:04.540
<b>He was here...</b>

16:12.180 --> 16:13.240
<b>Sakakura.</b>

16:14.050 --> 16:15.080
<b>What do you want?</b>

16:15.080 --> 16:16.650
<b>Someone came by today.</b>

16:16.650 --> 16:19.380
<b>My dad? Was he looking for me?</b>

16:19.380 --> 16:21.950
<b>No. It was Old Lady Okaka.</b>

16:21.950 --> 16:23.160
<b>What?!</b>

16:23.160 --> 16:24.660
<b>Aizawa-kun saw her too.</b>

16:24.660 --> 16:27.630
<b>Damn it! Why am I the only one
who can’t seem to meet her?!</b>

16:27.630 --> 16:30.830
<b>Maybe she senses a dangerous
aura coming from you?</b>

16:30.830 --> 16:35.130
<b>That’s possible. She might be even stronger
now that she’s been reborn.</b>

16:35.130 --> 16:38.110
<b>Again with that reborn stuff? She just didn’t die.</b>

16:38.110 --> 16:42.640
<b>I bet the ghost stories we hear about
EmeLan are her doing, too!</b>

16:42.640 --> 16:44.280
<b>The one about the laughing sumo wrestler?</b>

16:44.280 --> 16:47.010
<b>Huh? It’s a wailing, blotchy old woman, isn’t it?</b>

16:48.010 --> 16:49.480
<b>Umm...</b>

16:49.480 --> 16:52.680
<b>If I remember correctly, this sumo wrestler
is standing by the side of the road...</b>

16:52.680 --> 16:54.750
<b>...and if you meet his gaze or try to talk to him...</b>

16:54.750 --> 16:57.960
<b>...he chases you to the ends of the
earth, laughing the whole way.</b>

16:57.960 --> 16:59.420
<b>No...</b>

16:59.420 --> 17:04.230
<b>You do get chased, but it’s an old
woman and not a sumo wrestler!</b>

17:04.230 --> 17:07.410
<b>The blotchy old woman chases you
while wailing every bit of the way!</b>

17:10.200 --> 17:11.970
<b>Whichever it is...</b>

17:12.640 --> 17:15.370
<b>There’s no way Old Lady Okaka
could’ve been in those stories.</b>

17:15.370 --> 17:17.080
<b>But it’s an old lady!</b>

17:17.080 --> 17:18.710
<b>A blotchy one, at that!</b>

17:18.710 --> 17:19.580
<b>She’s a tortoiseshell cat, right?</b>

17:19.580 --> 17:21.110
<b>I wonder...</b>

17:21.110 --> 17:24.080
<b>She definitely powered up, and can
now take the form of a human!</b>

17:24.080 --> 17:25.650
<b>You’re really pushing things now...</b>

17:25.650 --> 17:28.520
<b>You’re wrong. It’s just beyond your limit.</b>

17:28.520 --> 17:31.990
<b>I mean for me it’s fine, since I’ve seen a kappa and all.</b>

17:31.990 --> 17:37.300
<b>Miku said there was a kappa
too, but I haven’t seen one.</b>

17:37.300 --> 17:38.200
<b>See?!</b>

17:38.200 --> 17:40.970
<b>What do you mean, “see?!”
I don’t get you at times.</b>

17:40.970 --> 17:43.370
<b>But anyway, I <i>did</i> see Old Lady Okaka.</b>

17:44.420 --> 17:46.850
<b>Why is it just me?</b>

17:46.850 --> 17:48.810
<b>Stop at Next Platform</b>

18:11.110 --> 18:12.110
<b>Hey!</b>

18:14.980 --> 18:15.650
<b>Me?</b>

18:15.650 --> 18:18.080
<b>Umm... are you Aizawa-kun?</b>

18:18.080 --> 18:19.150
<b>Yeah...</b>

18:19.150 --> 18:20.880
<b>Thank goodness.</b>

18:21.690 --> 18:24.060
<b>I wanted to speak to you at some point.</b>

18:24.760 --> 18:26.660
<b>How do you know about me?</b>

18:26.660 --> 18:28.260
<b>Well, this is a pretty small place...</b>

18:28.260 --> 18:31.160
<b>...so new people and things become
big news quickly around here.</b>

18:31.160 --> 18:33.730
<b>Though in reality, I just heard about
you from Mikoshiba-san.</b>

18:35.870 --> 18:39.540
<b>When I was in elementary school, I lived in the city...</b>

18:39.540 --> 18:42.910
<b>...and when I entered middle school, I moved
here because of some family circumstances.</b>

18:42.910 --> 18:46.240
<b>Every day here is so boring that I want to die.</b>

18:47.780 --> 18:50.520
<b>How long are you going to be here, Aizawa-kun?</b>

18:50.520 --> 18:52.120
<b>I still haven’t decided...</b>

18:53.290 --> 18:54.950
<b>Will you become friends with me?</b>

18:56.660 --> 18:57.690
<b>No?</b>

18:57.690 --> 18:59.920
<b>Suddenly asking me like this is a bit...</b>

19:01.930 --> 19:03.330
<b>I guess you’re right.</b>

19:03.330 --> 19:05.900
<b>Then for now, why don’t we just
exchange cell phone numbers?</b>

19:07.270 --> 19:08.000
<b>Why?</b>

19:08.000 --> 19:09.470
<b>“Why”...?</b>

19:09.470 --> 19:11.970
<b>Don’t you want to become friends with me?</b>

19:11.970 --> 19:13.210
<b>Aren’t I any good?</b>

19:13.210 --> 19:14.870
<b>But... we just met...</b>

19:14.870 --> 19:17.780
<b>We can just get to know each other starting now.</b>

19:20.380 --> 19:22.250
<b>I’m Unno Shione.</b>

19:22.250 --> 19:25.720
<b>The characters in my name read “the field of
the sea” and “the sound of the ebb tide.”</b>

19:25.720 --> 19:27.450
<b>My house is in Emerald Land.</b>

19:27.450 --> 19:29.490
<b>The ghost fuss is keeping a lot of people
away from EmeLan, though.</b>

19:29.490 --> 19:31.490
<b>But if you like, feel free to stop by anytime.</b>

19:34.490 --> 19:35.860
<b>Well, see you again.</b>

20:14.800 --> 20:17.640
<b>Hey. Did you also come to see the ghosts, Mr. “I”?</b>

20:17.640 --> 20:18.470
<b>No...</b>

20:18.470 --> 20:21.540
<b>Now that I think of it, I hear you
saw Old Lady Okaka again?</b>

20:21.540 --> 20:23.910
<b>Yeah. At the Miyama Store.</b>

20:23.910 --> 20:27.080
<b>I tried to take a picture of her with
my cell phone, but I failed.</b>

20:27.080 --> 20:29.510
<b>Huh? You sure are courageous.</b>

20:30.920 --> 20:35.220
<b>Nobody who’s tried to get a picture of
Old Lady Okaka has gotten away unscathed.</b>

20:35.220 --> 20:36.760
<b>What do you mean?</b>

20:36.760 --> 20:40.430
<b>It’s a long story, but... huh?</b>

20:40.430 --> 20:42.260
<b>So why are you even here
in the first place?</b>

20:42.260 --> 20:44.730
<b>Unno</b>

20:42.930 --> 20:43.900
<b>Asking me “why” all of a sudden...</b>

20:43.900 --> 20:49.070
<b>I see! You’ve also realized the connection
Old Lady Okaka has to this place, haven’t you?</b>

20:49.070 --> 20:51.240
<b>Not really...</b>

20:51.240 --> 20:54.410
<b>I understand. 
You don’t have to say a word.</b>

20:54.410 --> 20:56.710
<b>We might just end up being good friends.</b>

20:56.710 --> 20:59.240
<b>Umm... more like you’re kind of annoying...</b>

21:19.900 --> 21:20.500
<b>There she is!</b>

21:24.470 --> 21:26.700
<b>I’ve finally seen her!</b>

21:27.870 --> 21:30.170
<b>Hey! Don’t run away!</b>

21:32.080 --> 21:34.180
<b>Damn it...</b>

21:34.180 --> 21:36.150
<b>Geez, Ryousuke.</b>

21:36.920 --> 21:40.620
<b>Try and read the atmosphere.
Things were going so well, too...</b>

21:40.620 --> 21:42.090
<b>“Things were going so well” for you two?</b>

21:42.090 --> 21:43.560
<b>No more than usual.</b>

21:43.560 --> 21:47.330
<b>Umm... I’ve been looking for you all day.</b>

21:47.330 --> 21:48.590
<b>For her?</b>

21:48.590 --> 21:49.330
<b>Yeah.</b>

21:49.330 --> 21:51.460
<b>Are you a pedophile?</b>

21:53.270 --> 21:54.300
<b>Geez.</b>

21:55.270 --> 21:57.640
<b>So Ayumu, you met with him, right?</b>

21:57.640 --> 21:59.300
<b>Yeah... but...</b>

22:00.510 --> 22:01.970
<b>Who was he?</b>

22:01.970 --> 22:03.140
<b>Wakkun!</b>

22:03.140 --> 22:04.380
<b>That’s what I’m saying...</b>

22:04.380 --> 22:07.110
<b>Who’s this Wakkun? What is he?</b>

22:09.110 --> 22:12.050
<b>You idiot! You can’t even remember that much?!</b>

22:12.880 --> 22:15.950
<b>Aizawa Ayumu, what did you come back here to do?!</b>

22:16.990 --> 22:17.690
<b>Ryousuke.</b>

22:17.690 --> 22:18.990
<b>What?</b>

22:18.990 --> 22:20.660
<b>Take me home.</b>

22:22.830 --> 22:23.660
<b>What’s wrong?</b>

22:23.660 --> 22:26.130
<b>T-They came out!</b>

22:28.830 --> 22:31.570
<b>You don’t remember these two either?</b>

22:34.870 --> 22:37.340
<b>Dosshiru and Shisshin.</b>

22:37.880 --> 22:39.180
<b>Did you forget about them, too?</b>

22:52.250 --> 22:59.820
Daremo shiranai kotoba de kimi he to

22:52.250 --> 22:59.820
On that nostalgic hill, I sang out to you

22:59.820 --> 23:06.530
Utaikaketa natsukashii oka de

22:59.820 --> 23:06.530
words that no one else knew.

23:09.530 --> 23:17.030
Tomare soyokaze kawaranu omoide

23:09.530 --> 23:17.030
The dying breeze and my unchanged memories

23:17.030 --> 23:23.710
Sotto misete ano koro no boku wa

23:17.030 --> 23:23.710
gently reveal to me what I was like back then.

23:23.710 --> 23:31.150
Aa yume wo aishite hitori ni natta

23:23.710 --> 23:31.150
Ah, I thought that being alone

23:31.150 --> 23:35.950
Sore de ii to omotta

23:31.150 --> 23:35.950
and cherishing my dream would be fine.

23:35.950 --> 23:44.630
Haruka na sora ni wa ima mo kimi ga iru darou

23:35.950 --> 23:44.630
I wonder if you’re still there right now in the distant sky?

23:44.630 --> 23:53.230
Yasashiku ikiru yo afureru namida koraeta

23:44.630 --> 23:53.230
Now I lead a simple life, having suppressed my overflowing tears.

23:53.230 --> 24:02.010
Mirai no melody ga shizuka ni yureru kisetsu

23:53.230 --> 24:02.010
The melody of the future is in the quietly stirring seasons.

24:02.010 --> 24:10.720
Aitai na itsu no hi ka... mattete

24:02.010 --> 24:10.720
I want to see you again, and I’m waiting for that day.

24:10.720 --> 24:19.260
Aitai ne boku wa mada humming boy

24:10.720 --> 24:19.260
I want to see you again, but I’m still a humming boy.

24:19.980 --> 24:24.120
<b>Now then, what’s going on in Tana
that’s drawn all of our attention?</b>

24:19.980 --> 24:22.970
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

24:24.120 --> 24:26.650
<b>Taruto-san, please give us your report
since you’re there at the scene.</b>

24:26.650 --> 24:27.620
<b>Taruto here!</b>

24:27.620 --> 24:29.960
<b>Hey, the mic’s not plugged in.</b>

24:29.960 --> 24:32.220
<b>Ah, sorry. One sec.</b>

24:32.220 --> 24:34.130
<b>Geez, please don’t fool around with this.</b>

24:34.130 --> 24:34.990
<b>Sorry.</b>

24:34.990 --> 24:37.500
<b>All right, we’re rolling. The camera’s rolling.</b>

24:37.500 --> 24:40.670
<b>We humbly apologize for that!
Now then, Taruto-san, your report.</b>

24:40.670 --> 24:43.300
<b>Yes! Reporter Taruto here!</b>

24:43.300 --> 24:46.240
<b>I’m sending all of you viewers
our data from here in Tana.</b>

24:46.240 --> 24:48.510
<b>Right now, there are no 
abnormalities detected!</b>

24:48.510 --> 24:50.680
<b>Ah, as expected of a pro. Good job, Taruto-chan.</b>

24:50.680 --> 24:54.050
<b>Now then, next time will be:
“The Famous Announcer Has Come.”</b>

24:54.050 --> 24:55.240
<b>Back to you, Taruto-san.</b>

24:55.010 --> 24:59.950
<b>The Famous Announcer Has Come</b>

24:55.240 --> 24:57.510
<b>Here’s where we’ll end our broadcast!</b>
